WEBVTT

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.340
Darkness is there for me to remember your lips.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.920
May I get some salt?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.860
Alright!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.520
Here is your water.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.690
- Yes! 
- Let's kiss.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.540
Salt, please.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:26.150
Radarman

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.840
Hey! Your face is all red, Yayoi-san!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.360
She said "Let's kiss."

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:37.140
- Kisu (sillago)? - The fish?
- No!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:43.770
It's the girl sitting in the back. Take a quick peek.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.790
She's into you?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:53.500
- It's a girl!
- It happens sometimes.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:58.280
But, who is she that she'll do such a racy thing?

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:02.350
- What are you guys talking about?
- Behave yourself.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:08.440
That girl tried to kiss Yayoi-chan just right now.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.710
- Wado!
- Pervert! - She's a pervert!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.640
I would like to think that there are fans of café workers but...

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.640
-...how audacious. 
 - Acting on Yayoi's vulnerability.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:30.730
- Even if she' a girl she's extremely audacious!
 - I'm going to go over there!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.380
Here's some Aimi tea.

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.610
- You're good at kissing.
- What?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.030
The second time turns into a third.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.520
That's what love is.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:58.260
- Oh, I...
- Um...

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.190
You can't do that here.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.360
My heart is beating really fast!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:12.220
- Arashi-san! 
- I was taken advantage of! - What's wrong?

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.210
This girl has something to say to you.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:21.130
- You want to go at it?! I won't take you lightly!
- I apologize for earlier!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.810
I'm actually a manga illustrator.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:29.360
- A professional manga illustrator and a pervert?! 
- What does a manga illustrator want from me?!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.380
Can you model for me?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.040
- A model?
- There's a scene that I have a hard time drawing.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:41.970
But, when I saw you earlier I was enlightened. 
 If I have you as my model...

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:47.170
...I might be able to draw that scene that I thought I couldn't draw for a long time!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.890
Oh! So she was thinking about a plot for her manga!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.690
That's why she was acting all weird.
 Now it makes sense.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.940
Drawing the manga must be hard.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.600
I loved reading <i>Norakuro</i> and <i>Dankichi</i>.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:07.520
I heard that if you command your assistants to draw...

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:13.460
...they have to draw anything! 
 They have to have the will and the heart of a soldier!

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:19.060
If I can be of any help, I would love to!

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.950
- Really?! You'll model for me? 
- I'll never go back on my words!

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:28.250
I always thought I could make it as an actress!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:32.310
- Yea! She's the Shiomi Etsuko of Hakobune!
- Thank you so much!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:36.330
So, what kind of scene am I modeling for?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.390
It's actually a lonely kissing scene.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:45.220
- Kissing scene?- Kissing scene?
- Kissing scene? - Love scene?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:50.570
I really can't understand a girl's feelings towards the boyfriend.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.200
If I can't convey that in my drawing I'm not satisfied!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:06:00.590
- You're going to make Arashi-san do something scandalous?! 
- Too late.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.650
Who's going to be her partner? 
 You can't do a kissing scene without a partner.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:10.810
- Senpai, are you going to be OK with that?
- Um, um---

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:16.130
But---

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:20.150
A kissing scene, I---

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.530
- Umeyashiki-san? 
- Who's that?

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.460
I didn't know you were here professor!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:38.530
- Nice to meet you I'm the editor Umeyashiki! 
- Editor?

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:44.130
Can you come with me? Today's the deadline, you know that right?

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:51.360
- What's happening? 
 - She's the one that collects the drafts for the manga.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:55.720
She's here to put pressure on her because the deadline is close.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:02.070
- Can you wait a little bit? I just have one more page!
- We can't wait anymore!

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.640
You're going to be locked down at the print shop! 
 Let's go!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:10.340
- Locked down? What does that mean? 
- Be drug around town?

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.470
- Salt! 
 - Wait a minute!

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:25.170
What?!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:30.730
- Who are you?!
- Back up, back up. - I'm here.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:36.050
I was born in Kanagawa, Japan. 
 Knocking at the door was...

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:41.460
...the sound of the cultural enlightenment in the city of Yokohama!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:46.910
I was raised on the campus of Ookurayama Secondary Girls' School. 
 I surpassed this world and time...

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.820
Last name: Arashiyama First name: Sayoko.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:53.170
People call me Arashi of summertime!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:59.760
Everyone that comes to this store has a guilty conscience on their mind.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:05.740
My duty is to protect those who come to this store from the harsh eye of society.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:12.110
- Now, you have to respect my rules and behave yourself here! 
- Way to go.

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:17.200
- She seems frustrated.
- What? You just stay out of my business!

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:22.540
I won't let you have your way, she's depending on us.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:27.370
- I won't let things slip away that easy!
- Senpai!

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:33.060
- I told you no! No!
- Leave it to me.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:37.550
I flow like the cherry blossom petals and take a breath like the snow.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:42.380
Watch my kissing scene that this woman will display!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:47.040
Funny.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.000
You're funny, alright.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:58.710
I will let you have your way, but...

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:03.280
If it goes past six o'clock, I'll forcefully take the draft.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:08.810
Further, you'll also be working as my assistant in my department, for life!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:10.830
Understood.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.780
What happens when the draft is late?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.840
First, the printing will be delayed.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:24.320
Then the delivery will be late and the comic books won't make it to the store in time.

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:27.220
It will cause a lot of inconvenience for everyone.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:30.280
- It's like Jenga.
- More like dominos.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:35.540
- Jenga. 
 Can you help her finish, Arashi?

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:42.070
I can't believe you!
What are you going to do?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.820
I promised them! 
 I'll do something about it.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:52.580
But, you have to do a kissing scene that'll spark the imagination of Anamori-san.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.890
I'll do something.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:01.810
Natsu No Arashi!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.330
This is the draft of the manga?

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:11.750
That's where I need a big kissing scene! 
That's where I need a model.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:19.300
- Can I just act out the kiss by myself?
- No you have to have a partner or else I won't be inspired!

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.170
Partner for kissing?
 Disgusting.

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:26.630
If we have to choose among us, Hajime would be the best choice.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:31.190
- But, he's stupid.
- Hey leave that out of it! I won't do it, ever!

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:35.010
- I didn't expect that.
-What do you mean unexpected?!

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:40.100
That's not good, we don't have anyone else.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.310
That pose is great!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.970
If you'd be Arashi-san's partner, it'll be great!

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:54.060
- Why, must I---two girls?
 - I don't mind.

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:59.120
Well actually a beautiful woman like you, brings about new inspiration!

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:03.770
- It's just posing, just do it.
- No way! Arashi?!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.750
I don't mind. If you can do it, please do it.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.990
- Please!
- Salt!

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.980
Your face is too close.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:18.360
We can't do anything about it. It's a kissing scene.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:23.710
Embrace each other more!
 Put your lips closer!

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.420
<i>The Cherry Orchard</i>

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:34.350
Kaya, did you eat gyoza?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.830
Why would a lady eat gyoza in the morning?!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:45.020
- I didn't eat it.
- She picked one out of the refrigerator.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:50.760
- I didn't eat it. 
- I was almost there, but talking about gyozas.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.640
It's too much for you, huh?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:12:00.660
Yes, yes! I thought my heart was going to pop out of my mouth!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:06.110
Great! I like that simple reaction!

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:10.700
Switch with Kaya-san and embrace Arashi-san, please!

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.500
- Me?
- With Yayoi-chan?!

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.420
No! Never!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.460
But, if the draft is late, it'll be inconvenient for everyone.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.520
I got it.
I'll do it!

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:30.000
- Senpai---
- Yayoi---

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.960
Forbidden Love?

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.890
Yayoi!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:45.840
Yayoi is my life!

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:48.000
- I was unaware that I did this--- 
- Who are you? Minamino Yoko?

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:49.810
Oh, I'm relieved.

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.860
I allowed it in my heart, but my body won't allow it.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:58.700
Please, use me instead of Yayoi.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:00.040
Kana-chan.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:05.170
Great! 
 I love that passion! I'm inspired!

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:09.600
I can probably draw a good scene! 
 Can you do it for me Kanako-san?!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.190
How irresponsible.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.430
Arashi-san!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.780
I didn't know Kanako had experience in kissing someone.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.650
- How did you know?!
- I can tell. Am I right?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.750
- Kanako! 
- No! It's not true, Yayoi!

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:41.420
It's a misunderstanding! 
 I always see it in the moving pictures, you know?!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:45.050
I mean, I don't watch all those things, but...

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.150
That had an adverse effect.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.920
Take responsibility for it and go next.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:53.140
I can't do it.
 I can't act like I'm doing it.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.010
I can show you how to kiss like an adult, but...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:02.120
Isn't that unfortunate for Arashi since it's her first time.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:05.180
- I'm alright! I refuse to!
- So that leaves...

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:13.460
No I can't! 
 I'm a guy and there's too much of a height difference.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.010
This is too much. It's impossible.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:24.330
How about him? 
 You guys are about the same height.

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.580
No I refuse!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:33.370
<i>I can't stand seeing them trying to taint Arashi-san's purity!</i>

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:36.400
Jun, I don't mind.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.870
- I'm serious.
- No, Yasaka!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.570
Just shut up and close your eyes!

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.320
Oh look! Sugawara Bunta!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.780
I thought I saw him running through here.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:12.010
You pervert!

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:30.810
I didn't like this request in the first place.
 Ever since they told me in Ginza.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:34.660
If they didn't pull Seki-san's name I wouldn't have taken this request.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:39.220
Everything about this assignment doesn't suit me well.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:44.570
But, the girls and rewards were too great for me to surpass.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.560
I don't think this will turn out well.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:51.380
When someone begs me, I know they have an agenda.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:55.460
The more a person begs me, I know that they'll turn their back on me as quickly.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:07.980
Therefore, for me to take this assignment, I might be forgotten as easily.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:11.930
I need to realize that I might be sacrificed depending on the situation.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:16.870
Girls and money. The two things that I don't have a good relationship with.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:23.460
Hi is this Hideo-san? 
 This is Fujimi from Hakobune.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.930
I don't have anything to order. 
 I'm not hungry either.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:31.010
No, I have a favor to ask you.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.620
Unfortunately, I'm in the mountains.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:36.110
I can't help you right now.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.020
Alright, I'm sorry to have bothered you.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.070
Hang up. 
 Hang up!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:45.730
Alright.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.120
- I told you, hang up!
- Yes!

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:56.080
- What is it that you want! Tell me! 
- Actually...

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.580
You sound so happy.

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:05.480
A request has to be made that way.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:11.210
- A kiss?!
- We're adults here.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.200
Don't be selfish!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:21.050
I can't leave a troubled soul alone.

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:25.930
But, alright.
 I guess?

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:30.640
If it's a job, I don't care who it is. Even the president.

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:33.540
But, you're alright with that?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.410
- It's a done deal. 
- How perverted!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:42.620
Hi, someone called me for a kissing scene?

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:52.750
Alright! Go!

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:55.740
I won't do it!

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:59.690
You fool! We can't get any money for modeling now!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.130
That's what you were after.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.900
Actually, I don't get any inspiration from two guys.

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.480
You should have told me beforehand.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:13.200
Um, can I ask you something?
 Was it---Hajime-kun?

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.800
Can you do a scene with Arashi-san?

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.290
Impossible! Impossible, Impossible!!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.870
Really? It seems like you two would do well together.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:28.490
- I can't do it! 
- I'd prefer it a billion times better if it was Jun!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:34.990
- Hajime-chan! A billion times better? Isn't that saying too much? 
- Why are you getting mad at me?

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:40.470
- You're right.
- How about you kiss me then?

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:47.220
We're both girls and we won't have a problem. 
 Please, can you do it?

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.520
Relax.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:57.190
We should have done this in the beginning.
 Arashi-san.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:01.270
You have this elegant aura that you exist outside the bounds of time.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:08.880
I can only embrace someone that has that aura.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.860
- No. - Salt!
- Wait a minute.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:22.070
Even if you're a girl. You're trying to con her into kissing you!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:27.390
Even if the gods forgive you, I Yasaka Hajime won't forgive you!

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:34.840
I'm just left to this. I'll just have to do this!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:40.220
- No! He's gone crazy!
 - No! Hajime-chan!

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.210
Are you alright?!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.000
There! I'm enlightened!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:52.110
With Hajime's help, I can draw a great scene now!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:20:01.340
There we go! Now she's unstoppable!

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:04.270
- We're close to being done.
- Salt! - With that?

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.340
What was that all about?!

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:11.340
- Thank you for your help, everyone. 
- That's right. Thanks.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.490
That was a great one Sogoru-san!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:22.210
Love and friendship are two plants that have the same root.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:26.380
Love just happens to have more flowers.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:45.880
What are you doing up here? 
Everyone is waiting for you downstairs.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.440
The summer festival is about to begin.

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.680
Thanks, Hajime-chan.

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:58.550
I want to see you in the yukata ASAP too!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:07.820
Hajime-chan. 
 The kiss between Anamori-san and I...

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:10.210
...why did you stop it?

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.420
- You're going to ask me that now?
- Just answer it.

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:19.480
I don't remember. 
My body just stopped it.

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:25.950
Arashi-san, why did you stop Anamori and I, then?

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:30.980
- Did I stop you?
- You did! Without a doubt!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:34.260
- That's unfair!
- I don't know.

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:36.490
- What's that about?!
- Anyway...

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:42.100
- ...this happened because you didn't say OK in the beginning. 
- It's my fault?

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:49.330
Right, everything is your fault!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:59.780
- Arashi-san, don't you want to stay here a little longer?
- Nope.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.170
Everyone is waiting.

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:07.230
Hey! Arashi-san!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:19.050
First kiss with someone you like...

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:21.530
...will be wasted in front of other people.

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.430
Yea, it's not right.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:33.210
- Speaking about summertime...
- Heat that you can feel!

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:37.440
- Melting ice cream! - Beach! 
 - Bathing suits! - Tokoroten! - Strawberries?!

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:40.850
- Goldfish. 
- What about you Arashi-san? - Of course it's Arashi!

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:43.810
- Wake up early next week! 
 - Salt!

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:49.320
See you next week!
